  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.691 New Hampshire’s emergency services reporting (NHESR) administrator",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.691 “New Hampshire’s emergency services reporting (NHESR) administrator” means a person who is assigned as a NHESR administrator for a unit and who has permission to access and modify specific NHESR data.\n\nSource. #14328, eff 7-23-25, EXPIRES: 7-23-35",
